#: rc.cpp:1 rc.cpp:25 rc.cpp:64
msgid "Form1"
msgstr "Ffurf1"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "<b>Advanced Options</b>"
msgstr "<b>Dewisiadau Uwch</b>"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&Hide button size:"
msgstr "&Maint botwm cuddio:"

#: rc.cpp:4 rc.cpp:6
msgid " This setting defines how large the panel hide buttons will be if they are visible."
msgstr "Diffinia'r gosodiad yma pa mor fawr yw'r botymau cuddio os ydynt i'w gweld."

#: rc.cpp:5 rc.cpp:170
msgid "pixels"
msgstr "picseli"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Fade out applet handles"
msgstr "&Pylu dolenni rhaglennigion"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid " All applets that appear on the KDE panel have a small handle associated with them. By selecting this option these handles will be faded out and not shown by default."
msgstr "Mae gan bob rhaglennig sydd ar y panel KDE ddolen fach. Trwy ddewis y dewisiad yma fe bylir y dolenni yma, ac ni fyddant i'w gweld yn rhagosod."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "&Resizeable handle"
msgstr "Dolen maint &newidiol"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid " With this option enabled you can click and drag the edge of the panel to freely resize it. The panel's size has to be set to \"Custom\". This option can also be set in the panel's context menu."
msgstr "Â'r dewisiad yma'n alluog gallwch glicio a llusgo ymyl y panel i newid ei faint fel y dymunoch. Rhaid gosod maint y panel yn \"Addasiedig\". Gellir gosod y dewisiad yma drwy ddewislen gyd-destun y panel hefyd."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Transparency shade to:"
msgstr "Cysgodi tryloywder hyd at:"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Min"
msgstr "Isaf"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Max"
msgstr "Uchaf"

#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:104 rc.cpp:133
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Ffurf2"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Security Level"
msgstr "Lefel Ddiogelwch"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Load only trusted applets internal"
msgstr "Llwytho dim ond rhaglennigion mewnol ymddiriedadwy"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Load startup config applets internal"
msgstr "Llwytho rhaglennigion ffurfweddu cychwynnol mewnol"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Load all applets internal"
msgstr "Llwytho pob rhaglennig mewnol"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "List of Trusted Applets"
msgstr "Rhestr o Raglennigion Ymddiriedadwy"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Available Applets"
msgstr "Rhaglennigion Ar Gael"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ">>"
msgstr ">>"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "<<"
msgstr "<<"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Trusted Applets"
msgstr "Rhaglennigion Ymddiriedir Ynddynt"

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Hide Mode"
msgstr "Modd Guddio"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Allow other &windows to cover the panel"
msgstr "Caniatáu i &ffenestri eraill orchuddio'r panel"

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid " If this option is selected, the panel will allow itself to be covered by other windows."
msgstr "Os dewisir y dewisiad yma, bydd y panel yn caniatáu i ffenestri eraill ei orchuddio."

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "&Only hide when a panel-hiding button is clicked"
msgstr "&Cuddio pan glicir botwm cuddio'r panel yn unig"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid " If this option is selected, the only way to hide the panel will be to click on the hide buttons that appear on either end of it."
msgstr "Os dewisir y dewisiad yma, clicio ar un o'r botymau cuddio ar ei naill ben fydd yr unig modd o guddio'r panel."

#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "&Show panel when switching desktops"
msgstr "&Dangos panel pan yn newid penbwrdd"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid " If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically show itself for a brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can see which desktop you are on."
msgstr "Os yw'r dewisiad yma'n alluog, fe ddengys y panel ei hun am amser byr pan newidir y penbwrdd fel y gallwch weld ar pa benbwrdd yr ydych."

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Hide a&utomatically"
msgstr "Cuddio'n &ymysgogol"

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid " If this option is selected, the panel will automatically hide after a period of time and reappear when you move the mouse to the screen edge where the panel is hidden. This is particularly useful for small screen resolutions, such as on laptops."
msgstr "Os dewisir y dewis yma, cuddia'r panel ar ôl amser penodol, gan ymddangos pan symudwch y lygoden i ymyl y sgrîn lle mae'r panel yn cuddio. Mae hyn yn arbennig o ddefnyddiol ar gydraniadau sgrîn bach, megis cluniaduron."

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "sec"
msgstr "eil"

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "Immediately"
msgstr "Ar Unwaith"

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid " Here you can change the delay after which the panel will disappear if not used."
msgstr "Yma gallwch newid hyd yr oedi cyn i'r panel ddiflannu os na'i ddefnyddir."

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid "after the &cursor leaves the panel"
msgstr "wedi i'r &cyrchydd adael y panel"

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "&Raise when the pointer touches the screen's:"
msgstr "&Codi pan gyffyrdda'r pwyntydd â rhan yma'r sgrîn:"

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid " When this option is selected, moving the pointer to the specified edge of the screen will cause the panel to appear on top of any windows that may be covering it."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, bydd symud y pwyntydd i ymyl penodol y sgrîn yn achosi i'r panel ymddangos uwchlaw unrhyw ffenestri sydd yn ei orchuddio."

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Top Left Corner"
msgstr "Cornel Pen-Chwith"

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "Top Edge"
msgstr "Ymyl Uchaf"

#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Top Right Corner"
msgstr "Cornel Pen-Dde"

#: rc.cpp:44
msgid "Right Edge"
msgstr "Ymyl Dde"

#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Bottom Right Corner"
msgstr "Cornel Gwaelod-Dde"

#: rc.cpp:46
msgid "Bottom Edge"
msgstr "Ymyl Waelod"

#: rc.cpp:47
msgid "Bottom Left Corner"
msgstr "Cornel Gwaelod-Chwith"

#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "Left Edge"
msgstr "Ymyl Chwith"

#: rc.cpp:49
msgid " Here you can set the location on the screen's edge that will bring the panel to the front."
msgstr "Yma gallwch osod y lleoliad ar ymyl y sgrîn fydd yn dod a'r panel i'r blaen."

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid "Panel-Hiding Buttons"
msgstr "Botymau Cuddio'r Panel"

#: rc.cpp:51
msgid " This option controls the panel-hiding buttons, which are buttons with a small triangle found at the ends of the panel. You can place a button at either end of the panel, or both. Clicking on one of these buttons will hide the panel."
msgstr "Rheola'r dewisiad yma fotymau cuddio'r panel, sef botymau â thriongl bach ar bennau'r panel. Gallwch roi botwm ar un pen neu'r llall, neu ar y ddau ben. Bydd clicio ar un o'r botymau yma'n cuddio'r panel."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:202 rc.cpp:52
msgid "Show left panel-hiding bu&tton"
msgstr "Dangos bo&twm chwith cuddio'r panel"

#: rc.cpp:53
msgid " When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the left end of the panel."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, ymddengys botwm cuddio'r panel ar ben chwith y panel."

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "Show right panel-hiding &button"
msgstr "Dangos &botwm dde cuddio'r panel"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid " When this option is selected, a panel-hiding button appears on the right end of the panel."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, ymddengys botwm cuddio'r panel ar ben dde y panel."

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid "Panel Animation"
msgstr "Bywlunio'r Panel"

#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "A&nimate panel hiding"
msgstr "Bywlu&nio cuddio'r panel"

#: rc.cpp:58
msgid " When this option is selected the panel will \"slide\" off the screen when hiding. The speed of the animation is controlled by the slider directly below."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, fe \"lithra\"'r panel o'r sgrîn pan yn cuddio. Rheolir cyflymder y bywlunio gan y llithrydd yn union isod."

#: rc.cpp:59
msgid "Determines how quickly the panel hides if hiding animation is enabled."
msgstr "Penna pa mor gyflym y cuddia'r panel os yw bywlunio cuddio'n alluog."

#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cyflym"

#: rc.cpp:61
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Canolig"

#: rc.cpp:62
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Araf"

#: rc.cpp:63 rc.cpp:183
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Paneli"

#: rc.cpp:65
msgid " If this option is selected, informational tooltips will appear when the mouse cursor moves over the icons, buttons and applets in the panel."
msgstr "Os dewisir y dewisiad yma, bydd cynghorion offer yn ymddangos pan fo'r cyrchydd llygoden yn symud dros yr eiconau, botymau, a'r rhaglennigion yn y panel."

#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "&General"
msgstr "&Cyffredinol"

#: rc.cpp:67
msgid "Enable icon &zooming"
msgstr "Galluogi &chwyddo eiconau"

#: rc.cpp:68
msgid " When this option is selected the button icons are zoomed when the mouse cursor is moved over them."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, chwyddir eiconau'r botymau pan symuda'r cyrchydd llygoden drostynt."

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid "Sh&ow tooltips"
msgstr "Dang&os cynghorion offer"

#: rc.cpp:70
msgid " When this option is selected informational tooltips will appear when the mouse cursor moves over the icons, buttons and applets in the panel."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, bydd cynghorion offer yn ymddangos pan fo'r cyrchydd llygoden yn symud dros yr eiconau, botymau, a'r rhaglennigion yn y panel."

#: rc.cpp:71
msgid "B&utton Background"
msgstr "Cefndir B&otymau"

#: rc.cpp:72
msgid "De&sktop access:"
msgstr "Cyrchu Pe&nbwrdd:"

#: rc.cpp:73 rc.cpp:93
msgid "Choose a tile image for desktop access buttons."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil ar gyfer botymau cyrchu penbwrdd."

#: rc.cpp:74
msgid "&K menu:"
msgstr "Y ddewislen &K:"

#: rc.cpp:75 rc.cpp:95
msgid "Choose a tile image for the K menu."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil i'r ddewislen K."

#: rc.cpp:76
msgid "&Legacy applications:"
msgstr "&Hen Gymhwysiadau:"

#: rc.cpp:77 rc.cpp:85
msgid "Choose a tile image for legacy application buttons."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil i fotymau'r hen gymhwysiadau."

#: rc.cpp:78
msgid "&QuickBrowser menus:"
msgstr "Dewislenni Porwr&Cyflym:"

#: rc.cpp:79 rc.cpp:87
msgid "Choose a tile image for Quick Browser buttons."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil i fotymau PorwrCyflym."

#: rc.cpp:80
msgid "&Window list:"
msgstr "Rhestr &Ffenestri:"

#: rc.cpp:81 rc.cpp:91
msgid "Choose a tile image for window list buttons."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil i fotymau'r restr ffenestri."

#: rc.cpp:82
msgid "Applicatio&ns:"
msgstr "Cy&mhwysiadau:"

#: rc.cpp:83 rc.cpp:89
msgid "Choose a tile image for buttons that launch applications."
msgstr "Dewiswch ddelwedd deil i fotymau sy'n cychwyn cymhwysiadau."

#: rc.cpp:96
msgid "Panel Background"
msgstr "Cefndir y Panel"

#: rc.cpp:97
msgid "Enable &transparency"
msgstr "Galluogi &tryloywder"

#: rc.cpp:98 rc.cpp:100
msgid " If this option is selected, you can choose a background image that will be displayed on the panel. If it is not selected, the default colors will be used, see the 'Colors' control module."
msgstr "Os dewisir y dewisiad yma, gallwch ddewis delwedd gefndir i'w ddangos ar y panel. Os na'i ddewisir, defnyddir y lliwiau rhagosod. Gweler y modiwl rheoli 'Lliwiau'."

#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Enable &background image"
msgstr "Galluogi delwedd &gefndir"

#: rc.cpp:101
msgid " Here you can choose a theme to be displayed by the panel. Press the 'Browse' button to choose a theme using the file dialog.<p> This option is only active if 'Enable background image' is selected."
msgstr "Yma gallwch ddewis thema i'w dangos gan y panel. Gwasgwch y botwm 'Pori' i ddewis thema drwy'r ymgom ffeil.<p> Dim ond os y dewisid 'Galluogi delwedd gefndir' y mae'r dewis yma'n weithredol."

#: rc.cpp:102
msgid "This is a preview for the selected background image."
msgstr "Dyma ragolwg o'r delwedd gefndir dewisiedig."

#: rc.cpp:103
msgid "Advanc&ed Options..."
msgstr "Dewisiadau &Uwch..."

#: rc.cpp:105
msgid "K Menu"
msgstr "Y Ddewislen K"

#: rc.cpp:106
msgid "Optional Sub Menus"
msgstr "Is-ddewislenni Dewisol"

#: rc.cpp:107
msgid " This is a list of the dynamic menus that can be displayed in the KDE menu in addition to the normal applications. Use the checkboxes to add or remove menus."
msgstr "Rhestr o'r dewislenni byw y gellir eu dangos yn y ddewislen KDE, ynghŷd â'r cymhwysiadau arferol. Defnyddiwch y blychau brith i ychwanegu neu waredu dewislenni."

#: rc.cpp:108
msgid "Menu item format:"
msgstr "Fformat eitemau dewislenni:"

#: rc.cpp:109
msgid " This is a preview of the tile that will be used for window list buttons."
msgstr "Dyma ragolwg o'r teil a ddefnyddir ar gyfer botymau rhestri ffenestri."

#: rc.cpp:110
msgid "&Name only"
msgstr "&Enw'n unig"

#: rc.cpp:111
msgid " When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with the application's name next to the icon."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, ymddengys enw'r cymhwysiad wrth ochr yr eicon yn y gofnod yn y ddewislen K."

#: rc.cpp:112
msgid "Na&me (Description)"
msgstr "E&nw (Disgrifiad)"

#: rc.cpp:113
msgid " When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with the application's name and a brief description in brackets next to the icon."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, ymddengys enw'r cymhwysiad a disgrifiad byr mewn cromfachau wrth ochr yr eicon yn y gofnod yn y ddewislen K."

#: rc.cpp:114
msgid "Des&cription (Name)"
msgstr "Dis&grifiad (Enw)"

#: rc.cpp:115
msgid " When this option is selected, items in the K Menu will appear with a brief description and the application's name in brackets next to the icon."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, ymddengys disgrifiad byr ac enw'r cymhwysiad mewn cromfachau wrth ochr yr eicon yn y gofnod yn y ddewislen K."

#: rc.cpp:116
msgid "Edit &K Menu"
msgstr "Golygu'r Ddewislen &K"

#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "Show &side image"
msgstr "Dangos delwedd &ochr."

#: rc.cpp:118
msgid ""
" <qt>When this option is selected an image will appear down the left-hand side of the K Menu. The image will be tinted according to your color settings.\n"
" \n"
" <p><b>Tip</b>: You can customize the image that appears in the K Menu by putting an image file called kside.png and a tileable image file called kside_tile.png in $KDEHOME/share/apps/kicker/pics.</qt>\n"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Pan ddewisir y dewisiad hyn bydd delwedd yn ymddangos lawr ochr chwith y ddewislen K. Fe fydd arlliw ar y ddelwedd yn ôl eich gosodiadau lliw.\n"
"\n"
" <p><b>Cynghoryn</b>: Gallwch addasu'r ddelwedd a ymddengys yn y ddewislen K drwy roi ffeil ddelwedd o'r enw kside.png a ffeil ddelwedd deiladwy o'r enw kside_tile.png yn $KDEHOME/share/apps/kicker/pics.</qt>\n"

#: rc.cpp:119
msgid "QuickBrowser Menus"
msgstr "Dewislenni PorwrCyflym"

#: rc.cpp:120
msgid "Ma&ximum number of entries:"
msgstr "&Uchafswm nifer cofnodion:"

#: rc.cpp:121 rc.cpp:122
msgid " When browsing directories that contain a lot of files, the QuickBrowser can sometimes hide your whole desktop. Here you can limit the number of entries shown at a time in the QuickBrowser. This is particularly useful for low screen resolutions."
msgstr "Pan yn pori cyfeiriaduron sy'n cynnwys llawer o ffeiliau, gall y PorwrCyflym weithiau guddio'ch penbwrdd cyfan. Yma gallwch gyfyngu'r nifer o gofnodion a ddengys ar y tro. Mae hwn yn ddefnyddiol iawn ar gyfer cydraniadau sgrîn isel."

#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "Sh&ow hidden files"
msgstr "Dang&os ffeiliau cudd"

#: rc.cpp:124
msgid " If this option is enabled, hidden files (i.e. files beginning with a dot) will be shown in the QuickBrowser menus."
msgstr "Os yw'r dewisiad yma'n alluog, dengys ffeiliau cudd (h.y. ffeiliau'n dechrau â dot) yn y dewislenni PorwrCyflym."

#: rc.cpp:125
msgid "QuickStart Menu Items"
msgstr "Eitemau'r Ddewislen DdechrauCyflym"

#: rc.cpp:126
msgid "Maxim&um number of entries:"
msgstr "Uchafs&wm nifer cofnodion:"

#: rc.cpp:127
msgid " This option allows you to define the maximum number of applications that should be displayed in the QuickStart menu area."
msgstr "Galluoga'r dewisiad hwn i chi ddiffinio uchafswm nifer y cymhwysiadau y dylid eu dangos ar arwyneb y ddewislen DdechrauCyflym."

#: rc.cpp:128
msgid " This option allows you to define how many applications should be displayed at most in the QuickStart menu area."
msgstr "Galluoga'r dewisiad hwn i chi ddiffinio sawl cymhwysiad y dylid eu dangos ar y tro, ar arwyneb y ddewislen DdechrauCyflym."

#: rc.cpp:129
msgid "Sho&w the applications most recently used"
msgstr "Dango&s y cymhwysiadau ddefnyddwyd ddiweddaraf"

#: rc.cpp:130
msgid " When this option is selected the QuickStart menu area will be filled with the applications you have used most recently."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, llenwir arwyneb y ddewislen DdechrauCyflym â'r cymhwysiadau a ddefnyddioch ddiweddaraf."

#: rc.cpp:131
msgid "Show &the applications most frequently used"
msgstr "Dangos &y cymhwysiadau ddefnyddir fwyaf"

#: rc.cpp:132
msgid " When this option is selected the QuickStart menu area will be filled with the applications you use most frequently."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, llenwir arwyneb y ddewislen DdechrauCyflym â'r cymhwysiadau rydych yn eu defnyddio fwyaf."

#: rc.cpp:134
msgid " This is a list of all the panels currently active on your desktop. Select one to configure."
msgstr "Dyma restr holl baneli gweithredol eich penbwrdd. Dewiswch un i'w ffurfweddu."

