#: rc.cpp:160
msgid "Len&gth"
msgstr "&Hyd"

#: rc.cpp:161
msgid ""
" This group of settings determines how the panel is aligned, including\n"
" how it is positioned on the screen and how much of the screen it should use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penna'r grŵp yma o osodiadau sut yr alinir y pane, gan gynnwys\n"
" sut y'i lleolir ar y sgrîn a faint o'r sgrîn y dylai ddefnyddio.\n"

#: rc.cpp:162
msgid " This slider defines how much of the screen's edge will be occupied by the panel."
msgstr "Penna'r llithrydd yma faint o ochr y sgrîn y cymera'r panel."

#: rc.cpp:163
#, c-format
msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

#: rc.cpp:164
msgid " This spinbox defines how much of the screen's edge will be occupied by the panel."
msgstr "Diffinia'r blwch troelli yma faint o ochr y sgrîn y cymera'r panel."

#: rc.cpp:165
msgid "E&xpand as required to fit contents"
msgstr "Chw&yddo faint sydd angen i ffitio'r cynnwys"

#: rc.cpp:166
msgid " When this option is selected, the panel will grow as necessary to accommodate the buttons and applets on it."
msgstr "Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, tyfa'r panel pan fo angen, i gynnwys y botymau a'r rhaglennigion arno."

#: rc.cpp:167
msgid "Si&ze"
msgstr "Main&t"

#: rc.cpp:168
msgid " This sets the size of the panel. You can also access this option via the panel context menu by right-clicking on some free space on the panel."
msgstr "Gosoda hyn faint y panel. Gallwch hefyd gyrchu'r dewisiad yma drwy'r ddewislen gyd-destun y panel drwy roi clic-dde ar le gwag ar y panel."

#: rc.cpp:169
msgid "This slider defines the panel size when the Custom option is selected."
msgstr "Penna'r llithrydd yma faint y panel pan ddewisir y dewisiad Addasiedig."

#: rc.cpp:171
msgid "This spinbox defines the panel size when the Custom option is selected."
msgstr "Penna'r blwch troelli yma faint y panel pan ddewisir y dewisiad Addasiedig."

#: rc.cpp:172
msgid "Tiny"
msgstr "Pitw"

#: rc.cpp:173
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Bach"

#: rc.cpp:174
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Arferol"

#: rc.cpp:175
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Mawr"

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:457 rc.cpp:176
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Addasiedig"

#: rc.cpp:177
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "Sgrîn"

#: rc.cpp:178
msgid " This preview image shows how the panel will appear on your screen with the settings you have chosen. Clicking the buttons around the image will move the position of the panel, while moving the length slider and choosing different sizes will change the dimensions of the panel."
msgstr "Dangosa'r rhagolwg hon sut yr ymddengys y panel ar eich sgrîn gyda'r gosodiadau y dewisoch. Bydd clicio'r botymau o amgylch y ddelwedd yn newid lleoliad y panel, tra fydd symud y llithrydd hyd a newid meintiau gwahanol yn newyd dimensiynau'r panel."

#: rc.cpp:179
msgid "Identify"
msgstr "Dynodi"

#: rc.cpp:180
msgid "This button displays each monitor's identifying number"
msgstr "Dengys y botwm yma rif dynodi bob monitor"

#: rc.cpp:181
msgid "Xinerama Screen"
msgstr "Sgrîn Xinerama"

#: rc.cpp:182
msgid " This menu selects which screen the Panel will be displayed on in a multiple- monitor system"
msgstr "Dewisa'r ddewislen hon ar ba sgrîn y dengys y Panel ar gysawd aml-fonitor"

#: rc.cpp:184
msgid "KDE Button"
msgstr "Botwm KDE"

